  "details": "Currently, when using VRCPortalMarker in search mode (empty roomId, World=None, sortHeading=Created), the `admin_approved` tag is automatically appended to the portal's search query. This tag is outdated, as most recently-made worlds are `system_approved`, but not `admin_approved`. This results in much fewer world results when searching for worlds.\nUse Case: I am creating a random portal generator. Having `admin_approved` appended to my portals' search queries reduces the total amount of possible world portals from ~16000 to ~5990",
